  "question": "Which buildings have 3+ mold reports in the last year?",
  "text": "There are 38 buildings that have received 3 or more mold reports in the past year. The highest number of mold reports for a single building is 6. Some notable examples include:\n- P-00932: 6 mold reports\n- P-01232: 5 mold reports\n- P-01219: 4 mold reports\n- P-01180: 4 mold reports\n- P-01273: 4 mold reports\n\nMost buildings on the list had exactly 3 mold reports in the last year.",
  "sql": "SELECT reports.property_id, COUNT(*) AS mold_reports_last_year\nFROM fixit.gold.reports\nWHERE reports.violation_category = 'MOLD_MOISTURE'\n  AND reports.reported_at BETWEEN date_add(YEAR, -1, CURRENT_DATE) AND CURRENT_DATE\n  AND reports.property_id IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY reports.property_id\nHAVING COUNT(*) >= 3\nORDER BY mold_reports_last_year DESC",
